reachy_mini_expressions_data

This package redistributes files by Pollen Robotics (https://www.pollen-robotics.com),
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE):

- emotions/: the Reachy Mini Emotions Library,
  https://huggingface.co/datasets/pollen-robotics/reachy-mini-emotions-library
  revision 873ae49f0b89114b7e535eff0c1f7560d21d9357.
  Recorded moves (<name>.json) and their sounds (<name>.ogg), with the
  dataset's metadata.jsonl and card (README.md).

- dances/: the Reachy Mini Dances Library,
  https://huggingface.co/datasets/pollen-robotics/reachy-mini-dances-library
  revision 3564295e72d41c1271f46bf5540a3fcad9d5f669.
  Recorded moves (<name>.json) and the dataset's card (README.md).

- sounds/: the sound files of the reachy-mini Python SDK 1.10.0
  (reachy_mini/assets/*.wav), https://pypi.org/project/reachy-mini/1.10.0/

The files are unmodified: they were only copied into this package.
